    <DataNode elementId="AT3G08860-MONOMER" textLabel="β-alanine aminotransferase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9SR86" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="355" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The activity of this enzyme has not been demonstrated &lt;i&gt;in vivo&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; but based on the protein sequence and the co-expression of transcripts of AT3G08860 with transcripts for other genes encoding other enzymes known to be involved in |FRAME: PWY-3982|, this protein is hypothesized to act as a &amp;beta;-alanine aminotransferase |CITS: [19413687]|.</Comment>
